#N canvas 120 120 700 400 12;
#X text 20 10 Drum grooves: ockm-drum-groove <n> writes a groove into every drum slot \, by the sound each slot plays \, across the whole pattern length. Sets the swing too. Ignored while a pattern loads. Then tells the screens and any part locked to the kick.;
#X obj 20 60 r ockm-drum-groove;
#X obj 20 90 spigot 1;
#X obj 140 60 r ockm-loading;
#X obj 140 85 == 0;
#X obj 20 120 moses 0;
#X obj 60 150 t b b f f;
